        "node_id": "n_1_2211d1",
        "thought_text": "Divide the garland into three groups based on their positions modulo 3 (i.e., positions 0, 1, and 2) and count the occurrences of each color in each group. Then, for each group, determine the most frequent color and recolor all other colors in that group to the most frequent one. This approach ensures that within each group, the majority color is used, minimizing the number of changes.",
