        "node_id": "n_2_bd82a6",
        "thought_text": "Consider the garland as a circular sequence and attempt to find a repeating pattern of length 3 that satisfies the condition for a nice garland. Start by fixing the first lamp's color and then try to extend this pattern while minimizing recolors. This method leverages the circular nature of the problem to find an optimal solution.",
